  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Day of Commemoration in Memory of the Victims of the Holocaust</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">27 January 2025 will mark the 80th anniversary of the liberation of the Nazi German concentration and extermination camp Auschwitz-Birkenau. Marking this important anniversary and the International Day of Commemoration in Memory of the Victims of the Holocaust, UNESCO is organizing a series of events recalling the continued relevance to teach and learn about the Holocaust, globally.</narrative>
